{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18686","headline":"种白蘘荷 · 柳宗元","name":"种白蘘荷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"血虫化爲疠，夷俗多所神。\n衔猜每腊毒，谋富不爲仁。\n蔬果自远至，盃酒盈肆陈。\n言甘中必苦，何用知其真。\n华洁事外饰，尤病中州人。\n钱刀恐贾害，饥至益逡巡。\n窜伏常战栗，怀故逾悲辛。\n庶氏有嘉草，攻禬事久泯。\n炎帝垂灵编，言此殊足珍。\n崎岖乃有得，托以全余身。\n纷敷碧树阴，眄睐心所亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18686.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18686","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}